      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "to fill the leave table we just add the values from both \neay_attendance_view and biotime_att_leave_view\nbecause sometimes the leave is justified on the easy project\nbut not on biotime and the same for oposite",
      "autoResize": true,
