      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771254281633,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Qt 1 : shoud i use the easy project employee table or the\nbiotime employee table to fill the Mainapp table ?\n\n- i cannot take the emlpoyee biotime table as a single source\nof truth if he does not contain\nonly employee in it (interns ext..)\n\nQ2 : Why there is two way to track a user \nbiotime --> att_leave table\neasyproject --> easy_attendace \n\n\neasy project attendace max date 2024-12-25 08:30:00\nbiotime clock_in_out max date 2026-01-31 and somtimes the\nclock in out is empty\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "qMWNJDXDJre1IXL6QbFN9",
      "originalText": "Qt 1 : shoud i use the easy project employee table or the  biotime employee table to fill the Mainapp table ?\n\n- i cannot take the emlpoyee biotime table as a single source of truth if he does not contain\nonly employee in it (interns ext..)\n\nQ2 : Why there is two way to track a user \nbiotime --> att_leave table\neasyproject --> easy_attendace \n\n\neasy project attendace max date 2024-12-25 08:30:00\nbiotime clock_in_out max date 2026-01-31 and somtimes the clock in out is empty\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
